Package: latinobarometro
Type: Package
Title: Download and Harmonize Latinobarometro Survey Waves
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jorge", "Soler-Lopez",
                  email = "jorge.solerlopez@unibocconi.it",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads waves of the Latinobarometro public opinion survey
    (1995-2024) directly from the Latinobarometro Corporation website, caches
    them locally, and optionally harmonizes variable names across waves using
    the official time-series crosswalk. Also constructs country-population
    scaled survey weights for pooled regional analysis by merging World Bank
    population totals. No survey data are redistributed by this package:
    files are retrieved by the user at run time from
    <https://www.latinobarometro.org>, and users remain bound by the
    Latinobarometro terms of use.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports:
    haven (>= 2.3.0),
    readxl,
    stats,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    WDI,
    curl,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0)
URL: https://github.com/jlopezton/latinobarometro-r
BugReports: https://github.com/jlopezton/latinobarometro-r/issues
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
